questions.scenario:
You are debugging a production issue where an order processing microservice fails to roll back local database transactions when a downstream REST call fails with a `HttpServerErrorException`. You inspect the Spring service implementation:

java
@Service
public class OrderService {
    @Autowired
    private OrderRepository orderRepo;
    @Autowired
    private PaymentClient paymentClient;

    public void processOrder(Order order) {
        try {
            this.executeTransaction(order);
        } catch (Exception e) {
            log.error("Failed processing order", e);
            throw e;
        }
    }

    @Transactional(rollbackFor = Exception.class)
    public void executeTransaction(Order order) {
        orderRepo.save(order);
        paymentClient.charge(order.getAmount()); // Throws HttpServerErrorException
    }
}
